G5543.b:
⟪χρηστός⟫, -ή, -όν
(< χράομαι), [in LXX chiefly for ⁨טוֹב⁩ (freq. of God: ⟦Psalms 25:8|Ps 24 (25):8⟧, al.), also for ⁨יָקָר⁩ (⟦Ezekiel 27:22|Ez 27:22⟧ ⟦Ezekiel 28:13|28:13⟧), ⁨יָשָׁר⁩ (⟦Proverbs 2:21|Pr 2:21⟧ ⁨א⁩ A) ;] ⟪serviceable, good⟫;
⟪(a)⟫ of things, ⟪good, pleasant⟫: of food (as often in cl.), οἶνος, ⟦Luke 5:39|Lk 5:39⟧; ζυγός, ⟦Matthew 11:30|Mt 11:30⟧ (EV, ⟪easy⟫); in ethical sense, ἤθη, ⟦1 Corinthians 15:33|I Co 15:33⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ of persons, ⟪good, kind, gracious⟫: ⟦Ephesians 4:32|Eph 4:32⟧; of God, ⟦Luke 6:35|Lk 6:35⟧, ⟦1 Peter 2:3|I Pe 2:3⟧; τ. χρηστὸν (= ἡ χρηστότης) τοῦ θεοῦ, ⟦Romans 2:4|Ro 2:4⟧.†

G5548.b:
⟪χρίω⟫ ⟪to anoint⟫ (Hom., al.);
[in LXX chiefly for ⁨משׁח⁩ of consecration to a sacred office: priest, ⟦Exodus 28:41|Ex 28:41⟧; prophet, ⟦1 Kings 19:16|III Ki 19:16⟧; king, ⟦1 Samuel 10:1|I Ki 10:1⟧; of things, ⟦Exodus 40:9|Ex 40:9⟧, ⟦Leviticus 8:10|Le 8:10⟧, al.]. In NT, metaph., of God's anointing,
⟪(a)⟫ Christ: ⟦Acts 4:27|Ac 4:27⟧; c. inf., ⟦Luke 4:18|Lk 4:18⟧ (LXX); c. dupl. acc (v. Bl., § 34, 4), ⟦Hebrews 1:9|He 1:9⟧ (LXX); πνεύματι ἁγίῳ, ⟦Acts 10:38|Ac 10:38⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ Christians: ⟦2 Corinthians 1:21|II Co 1:21⟧ (cf. Westc., Epp. Jo., 73) (cf. ἐν-, ἐπι-Χριω).† SYN: v.s. ἀλείφω

G5587.b:
† ⟪ψιθυρισμός⟫, -οῦ, ὁ
(< ψιθυρίζω, to whisper), [in LXX: ⟦Ecclesiastes 10:11|Ec 10:11⟧ (⁨לַחַשׁ⁩) * ;] ⟪a whispering⟫;
⟪(a)⟫ of secret slander, ⟦2 Corinthians 12:20|II Co 12:20⟧ (Plut.);
⟪(b)⟫ of a murmured enchantment, ⟦Ecclesiastes 10:11|Ec, l.c.⟧†

G5599.b:
⟪ὦ⟫ interj., c. vocat., ⟪O⟫;
⟪(a)⟫ in simple address (less freq. than in cl.; M, Pr., 71); ⟦Acts 1:1|Ac 1:1⟧ ⟦Acts 18:14|18:14⟧ ⟦Acts 27:21|27:21⟧, ⟦Romans 2:1|Ro 2:1⟧, ⟦Romans 2:3|3⟧ ⟦Romans 9:20|9:20⟧, ⟦1 Timothy 6:20|I Ti 6:20⟧; expressing reproof, ⟦James 2:20|Ja 2:20⟧;
⟪(b)⟫ in exclamations of surprise, etc.: ⟦Matthew 15:28|Mt 15:28⟧, ⟦Luke 24:25|Lk 24:25⟧, ⟦Acts 13:10|Ac 13:10⟧, ⟦Romans 11:33|Ro 11:33⟧, ⟦Galatians 3:1|Ga 3:1⟧; c. nom. (Bl., § 33, 4), ⟦Matthew 17:17|Mt 17:17⟧, ⟦Mark 9:19|Mk 9:19⟧, ⟦Luke 9:41|Lk 9:41⟧.†
